    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Energy (24 h)",
      "description": "kWh used by all plugs in the last 24 hours. Energy = sum of the counter's 5-minute increases, clamped at 0: sum_over_time(clamp_min(max by (alias) (kasa_power_total) - max by (alias) (kasa_power_total offset 5m), 0)[RANGE:5m]). Not increase(): kasa_power_total is re-seeded from the plug's own total when KasaMonitor restarts (and Tapo plugs report month-to-date energy), so the series can drop a little; increase() treats any drop as a counter reset and would add the whole cumulative value as new consumption. A gap longer than 5 minutes loses the energy of that gap.",
      "id": 4,
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time(clamp_min(max by (alias) (kasa_power_total) - max by (alias) (kasa_power_total offset 5m), 0)[24h:5m]) / 1000)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
